# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

config BR2_PACKAGE_RUSTOS_DVM_BLOCK
	bool "rustos-dvm-block"
	help
	  Fixed, address-free block relay for the isolated RustOS Linux storage
	  driver domain. A dedicated MSI-X UIO adapter binds only the exact
	  RSDVMBL1 aperture, maps that bounded aperture write-back, and exposes
	  only peer-0/vector-0 notification through UIO irqcontrol. The userspace
	  relay owns no PCI controller MMIO; Linux nvme/ahci and the block layer
	  remain the sole physical-device implementation.
